        <div class="eyebrow">Advising philosophy</div>
        <h2>Structure early, independence later</h2>
        <p>I typically begin with problems that are concrete enough to support steady progress. As students develop, the problems become more open-ended and the student takes increasing responsibility for choosing direction, building collaborations, and presenting the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Community</div>
        <h2>Vertical integration</h2>
        <p>Research groups are strongest when people at different stages work together. This principle is central to StemForAll, year-round undergraduate projects, and many collaborations that have led to papers and long-term professional relationships.</p>
        <p><a href="stemforall2026.html">StemForAll 2026</a></p>
